    <title>win10本地Docker搭建青龙面板</title>
    <link href="/2022/08/24/win10%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0Docker%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF/"/>
    <url>/2022/08/24/win10%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0Docker%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E9%9D%92%E9%BE%99%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h1><p>win10本地Docker搭建青龙面板，不用安装虚拟机，本教程以青龙2.10.13版本为例</p><h2 id="开始"><a href="#开始" class="headerlink" title="开始"></a>开始</h2><p>1，电脑开启了VT，任务管理器，性能，查看有没有开启，没开启自行百度查找开启方法</p><p><img src="/images/af7782754085452dbec549ff6c7d58ce.png"><br>2，打开【Hyper-V】，【适用于linux的windows子系统】和【虚拟机平台】，控制面板，程序和功能，启用或关闭Windows功能，如下图勾选，然后确定会让你重启，重启一下</p><p><img src="/images/7066959cf4204346a80f27e85802e14d.png"><br><img src="/images/ad8c3022413045f8960c667c70c535c4.png"><br>3，如果电脑没有【Hyper-V】，桌面新建文本，复制下面的代码，文件重命名为：Hyper.bat<br>（如果你的文本没有后缀，打开我的电脑（此电脑)–查看–点击右边的选项，再点查看，【隐藏已知文件类型的扩展名】前面的√去掉）<br><img src="/images/9ec4464ecf5a4bca8334fb5cd9d89691.png"></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">pushd</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%~dp0&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">dir</span> /b %SystemRoot%\servicing\Packages\*Hyper-V*.mum &gt;hyper-v.txt<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> /f %%i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> (<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;findstr /i . hyper-v.txt 2^&gt;nul&#x27;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">do</span> dism /online /norestart /add-package:<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%SystemRoot%\servicing\Packages\%%i&quot;</span><br>del hyper-v.txt<br>Dism /online /enable-feature /featurename:Microsoft-Hyper-V-All /LimitAccess /ALL<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行要一段时间等完成后会出选择重启，输入Y即可，然后接着第2步去勾选</p><p>4，下载linux内核更新包，适用于 x64 计算机的 WSL2 Linux 内核更新包<a href="https://wslstorestorage.blob.core.windows.net/wslblob/wsl_update_x64.msi">点此下载</a></p><p>5，下载docker电脑版<a href="https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/">docker官网</a></p><p>两个都安装好后重启一下电脑</p><p><img src="/images/7ab609fe5b5f4efc813a94c0d405ff0d.png"><br><img src="/images/4a67bd533f38475396fe4ab0385f5250.png"><br>6，在D盘创建Docker文件夹，然后在Docker文件夹内创建ql文件夹，再在里面创建其他几个必须文件夹</p><figure class="highlight excel"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs excel">config<br><span class="hljs-built_in">db</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">log</span><br>raw<br>repo<br>scripts<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/images/229641f27e644918b1fe100978be263a.png"></p><h2 id="拉取青龙面板"><a href="#拉取青龙面板" class="headerlink" title="拉取青龙面板"></a>拉取青龙面板</h2><p>7，创建好之后，鼠标右键点击左下角菜单 PowerShell(管理员)，输入拉取青龙2.10.13命令，端口自行修改</p><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">D:<br>cd Docker<br>docker run -dit -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>config:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>config -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>log:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>log -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>db:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>db -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>repo:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>repo -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>raw:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>raw -v <span class="hljs-regexp">/D/</span>Docker<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>scripts:<span class="hljs-regexp">/ql/</span>scripts -p <span class="hljs-number">5700</span>:<span class="hljs-number">5700</span> --name qinglong --hostname qinglong -e TZ=Asia<span class="hljs-regexp">/Shanghai --restart unless-stopped whyour/</span>qinglong:<span class="hljs-number">2.10</span>.<span class="hljs-number">13</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/images/1194c477782542208e6a49fee935164c.png"><br>8，如果拉取出现如下图错误，点击任务栏docker图标，鼠标右键选择settings，docker engine，修改buildKit&#x3D;false，修改后重启一下docker，重新第7步拉取</p><p><img src="/images/987d8eaa26e8485c9122c2f63113c845.jpeg"><br><img src="/images/2a9f1ea9fc9542efaf302fe4b4e983a6.png"><br><img src="/images/c22b153583374a33b759df5a0c189e14.png"><br>9，拉取成功后打开下面地址登录青龙面板</p><figure class="highlight accesslog"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs accesslog"><span class="hljs-number">127.0.0.1:5700</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="docker命令"><a href="#docker命令" class="headerlink" title="docker命令"></a>docker命令</h2><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">docker images <span class="hljs-comment">#查看所有镜像</span><br>docker <span class="hljs-built_in">ps</span> <span class="hljs-literal">-a</span> <span class="hljs-comment">#查看所有运行中的容器</span><br>docker <span class="hljs-built_in">ps</span> <span class="hljs-comment">#查看运行中的容器</span><br>docker <span class="hljs-built_in">rm</span> [<span class="hljs-type">container_id</span>] <span class="hljs-comment">#移除某个容器</span><br>docker stop [<span class="hljs-type">container_id</span>] <span class="hljs-comment">#停止某个容器</span><br>docker <span class="hljs-built_in">start</span> [<span class="hljs-type">container_id</span>] <span class="hljs-comment">#启动某个容器</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
